public cli tools lint fmt check install test_command build_command aot_compiler repl create upgrade type_schemas
about cli All of the `bun` command line that every executable carries: the package manager, the test runner, `bun build`, `bun lint`, `bun fmt`, `bun check`, the type checker and the ahead-of-time compiler, and the types of `JSON.parse<T>()` in TypeScript files that are loaded while the program runs. Only `BUN_BE_BUN=1` and `--help` reach it.
saves cli 47.3 42.2
public lint lint
about lint `bun lint`: the linter, its rules and what they say. A part of `"cli"`.
saves lint 12.2 12.0
public fmt fmt
about fmt `bun fmt`, the formatter. A part of `"cli"`. It shares most of its code with `"lint"`: the two together save 8 MB more.
saves fmt 0.2 0.0
public check check type_schemas
about check `bun check`, `--check`, and the type checks and declaration files of `bun build` and `Bun.build()`. A part of `"cli"`. The type checker's engine stays while `"lint"` or the ahead-of-time compiler stays.
saves check 0.3 1.1
public install install
about install The package manager: `bun install`, `add`, `remove`, `update`, `link`, `unlink`, `pm` with all of its subcommands, `patch`, `outdated`, `publish`, `audit`, `why`, `prune`, `dedupe`, `info` and `bunx`. A part of `"cli"`. Without it `-i`, `--install` and `install.auto` in `bunfig.toml` are refused.
saves install 1.8 2.2
public aot aot_compiler
about aot The ahead-of-time compiler: `bun build --compile --aot`, `bun compile` and `bun run --aot`. A part of `"cli"`. An executable that was itself built with `aot` does not need it.
saves aot 9.5 8.6
public repl repl
about repl `bun repl`. A part of `"cli"`.
saves repl 0.0 0.0
public create create
about create `bun create` and `bun init`. A part of `"cli"`.
saves create 0.0 0.0
public upgrade upgrade
about upgrade `bun upgrade`. A part of `"cli"`.
saves upgrade 0.0 0.0
public run tools
about run What is left of the command line: `bun run` with package.json scripts and `--filter`, `bun exec`, the help texts and shell completions. A part of `"cli"`. The executable still runs its own program.
saves run 0.6 0.0
public spawn child_process spawn shell cron webview open_in_editor terminal node_cluster process_execve hot_reload crash_report testing
absent spawn Bun.$ Bun.cron Bun.WebView Bun.Terminal
throws spawn Bun.spawn Bun.spawnSync Bun.openInEditor process.execve
about spawn Everything that starts another program, or this one again: `Bun.spawn()`, `Bun.spawnSync()` and with them `node:child_process` and `node:cluster`, `Bun.$`, `Bun.cron`, `Bun.WebView`, `Bun.Terminal`, `Bun.openInEditor()`, `process.execve()`, `--watch` and `--hot`, and the sending of crash reports. With `"cli"` and `"native-code"` removed too, no code that can start a program is left in the executable.
saves spawn 1.8 0.3
